      "tags": ["deep time", "pre-cambrian"]
    },
    {
      "ageMa": 540,
      "title": "Cambrian seas expand",
      "body": "Shallow seas flood continental margins as animal life diversifies. The coastline signal is simplified, but the tectonic stage is set.",
      "camera": [20, -10],
      "tags": ["cambrian", "marine"]
    },
    {
      "ageMa": 470,
      "title": "Iapetus Ocean narrows",
      "body": "Ocean basins between Laurentia, Baltica, and Avalonia begin closing, feeding future Appalachian and Caledonian mountain building.",
